#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:70
#: cdd7ed7abf75488d97b50e5e18dfa594
msgid ""
"`arx_acone` is the manipulator. Full-body **ARX Lift 2S** (`arx_lift2s`) "
"uses `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` on the `arx-lift2s` "
"branch — see [ARX Lift "
"2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md). HighTorque "
"Panthera HT launch name is `panthera_ht` — see [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)."
msgstr ""
"`arx_acone` 是操作臂。全身 **ARX Lift 2S**（`arx_lift2s`）在 `arx-lift2s` 分支上使用 `split_body.launch.py` / `full_body.launch.py` — 见 [ARX Lift 2S](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md)。高擎 Panthera HT 的 launch 名是 `panthera_ht` — 见 [高擎 Panthera HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:72
#: 43733b133f69443f9793759bba94a68d
msgid "End-effectors (`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`)"
msgstr "末端执行器（`type` / `left_type` / `right_type`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:74
#: ea09d94ddacb4bdaa068e0ccf7760137
msgid ""
"There is **no** `gripper:=` argument. End-effectors are selected by "
"**`robot_common_launch`**:"
msgstr "没有 **`gripper:=`** 参数。末端由 **`robot_common_launch`** 选择："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:76
#: 5743a20e2f66494185dcc43ff2c1569e
msgid "Symmetric EEF: `type:=<eef_key>`"
msgstr "对称末端：`type:=<eef_key>`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:77
#: 411d9f4626ae407da45cab92256b1d18
msgid ""
"Different left / right: `left_type:=` and `right_type:=` together; **do "
"not pass `type:=`** then (`create_eef_side_launch_arguments()`)"
msgstr ""
"左右不同：同时传 `left_type:=` 与 `right_type:=`；此时**不要再传 "
"`type:=`**（`create_eef_side_launch_arguments()`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:78
#: 3a3a3086c47b4ba58f03669ff6c0e2df
msgid ""
"`type` may also be arm topology `left` / `right` / `dual` (that does "
"**not** become `left_type` / `right_type`)"
msgstr ""
"`type` 也可以是臂拓扑 `left` / `right` / `dual`（**不会**展开成 `left_type` / "
"`right_type`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:79
#: f63041cf759a4c1a8cb0d9527a6e6712
msgid ""
"OCS2 `demo` / `split_body` / `full_body` declare these via "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()`. `basic_joint_controller` "
"`demo.launch.py` only declares `type`."
msgstr ""
"OCS2 的 `demo` / `split_body` / `full_body` 通过 "
"`create_robot_profile_launch_arguments()` 声明这些参数。`basic_joint_controller`"
" 的 `demo.launch.py` 只声明 `type`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:81
#: 347a6ae4e0dc47b5b4504605e308156c
msgid ""
"Profile YAML `defaults.end_effectors` is applied when "
"`use_profile_eef:=true` (default). Set `use_profile_eef:=false` to force "
"the CLI keys. Merge order: **CLI > profile > xacro defaults**. FT (`ft` /"
" `left_ft` / `right_ft`) and TCP offsets are separate and always take the"
" profile unless CLI overrides them."
msgstr ""
"`use_profile_eef:=true`（默认）时应用 profile YAML 的 `defaults.end_effectors`。设 "
"`use_profile_eef:=false` 以强制使用命令行键。合并顺序：**CLI > profile > xacro "
"默认值**。力传感器（`ft` / `left_ft` / `right_ft`）和 TCP 偏移是独立项，除非 CLI 覆盖，否则始终使用 "
"profile。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md:83
#: 91344f71079e4a9394d15f33fa11a5f0
msgid ""
"# README: ignore profile EEF, set L/R from CLI\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py \\\n"
"  robot:=<robot_name> \\\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  use_profile_eef:=false \\\n"
"  left_type:=rg75 right_type:=linkerhand_o7"
msgstr ""
"# README: ignore profile EEF, set L/R from CLI\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py \\\n"
"  robot:=<robot_name> \\\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  use_profile_eef:=false \\\n"
"  left_type:=rg75 right_type:=linkerhand_o7"

